What series/version/procesor/MB?
A few Alphas were intended for Windoze NT only and the SRM capability
was removed, i.e., White boxes and some variants of the PC164 series.
Some Alphas were not intended to use SRM but can (if you know the
tricks), i.e. Multia, AXPCI133 (no-name)
Some Alpha's were purposefully mis-configured with SCSI cards and
graphics cards that SRM does not support so that only NT will work in
their 'out of the box' configuration, i.e., PWS433A, 500A, 600A. (Miata)

Need more info on your system to see which category it falls into.

TomC

